    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>this is the first episode, more to come soon.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448270/extras/b6ac6d09aedd03b7d743fa512e05b0c0.avif?t=1744566349\" data-has-big width=800 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twilight Tales</strong> is a series of short games based on psychological horror and the choices you make, which will determine whether you survive or not. You choose your own ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448270/extras/207a223849f6f246ab503e075cc5e3d5.avif?t=1744566349\" width=795 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this first episode of <strong>Twilight Tales</strong>, you'll take care of the tasks in a small store deep in the woods, all while avoiding the dangers that come with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448270/extras/db45e4cddc5771226f02045ae41d44ff.poster.avif?t=1744566349\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448270/extras/db45e4cddc5771226f02045ae41d44ff.webm?t=1744566349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448270/extras/db45e4cddc5771226f02045ae41d44ff.mp4?t=1744566349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448270/extras/5b25f578c9c87253196abaaa8b2dd214.avif?t=1744566349\" width=795 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hollow's Store</strong> offers an immersive first-person experience thanks to mechanics like cleaning, restocking, checking out, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448270/extras/cfb461af69f31841576bae5c5098f5b9.avif?t=1744566349\" width=795 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features numerous traits, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic aesthetics and everyday atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleaning, checking out, and restocking mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive CCTV system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to NPCs</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>this is the first episode, more to come soon.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448270/extras/b6ac6d09aedd03b7d743fa512e05b0c0.avif?t=1744566349\" data-has-big width=800 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twilight Tales</strong> is a series of short games based on psychological horror and the choices you make, which will determine whether you survive or not. You choose your own ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448270/extras/207a223849f6f246ab503e075cc5e3d5.avif?t=1744566349\" width=795 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this first episode of <strong>Twilight Tales</strong>, you'll take care of the tasks in a small store deep in the woods, all while avoiding the dangers that come with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448270/extras/db45e4cddc5771226f02045ae41d44ff.poster.avif?t=1744566349\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448270/extras/db45e4cddc5771226f02045ae41d44ff.webm?t=1744566349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448270/extras/db45e4cddc5771226f02045ae41d44ff.mp4?t=1744566349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448270/extras/5b25f578c9c87253196abaaa8b2dd214.avif?t=1744566349\" width=795 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hollow's Store</strong> offers an immersive first-person experience thanks to mechanics like cleaning, restocking, checking out, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448270/extras/cfb461af69f31841576bae5c5098f5b9.avif?t=1744566349\" width=795 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features numerous traits, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic aesthetics and everyday atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleaning, checking out, and restocking mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive CCTV system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to NPCs</p></li></ul>",
